cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite this repository."
title: "Compact-Bench: Measuring What Context Compaction Costs Long-Horizon Coding Agents"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Compact-Bench contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cai-jianfeng/compact-bench"
abstract: >-
  Compact-Bench measures what context compaction costs long-horizon coding
  agents: Task Preservation on 35 SWE-bench repair tasks, Recurring-Detail
  Retention on 146 agentic sessions, and Production-Chain Retention across
  106 real multi-compaction chains.
keywords:
  - context compaction
  - coding agents
  - benchmark
  - long-horizon tasks
license: Apache-2.0
